$ claude "load customers.csv, compute monthly churn"
→ loaded 12,847 rows from customers.csv
→ cohorting by signup_month
→ monthly churn (last 6 mo): 11.4% 12.1% 13.0% 13.8% 13.9% 14.2%
→ cohort <30d has 2.3x the churn of >90d

$ claude "is it concentrated by plan?"
→ free→starter conversion drops 38% MoM
→ starter churn carries 71% of total churn
→ top cancel reason text: "couldn't get it set up"

$ claude "what about pro?"
→ pro plan churn flat at 4.1% for 6 months
→ enterprise: n=8 churned, no signal

$ claude "save the cohort table"
→ wrote cohort_table.csv (180 rows)
